      "medium_raw": "Carved in teak, overlaid with black thitsi lacquer (<i>Melanorrhoea usitat</i>) and gilt; heavily decorated in the <i>thayo</i> (relief moulded lacquer) and <i>hman-zi shwei-cha</i> (glass inlay) technique",
